# Continental seed 101, 2 AIs, start epoch 9, a low population limit (base ini unit_limit=60): the fortress reserve
# (bunker_reserve). Both AIs get 3000 of each at minutes 1, 15 and 30 (a WW1 start has too little wood for a fortress
# before minute 20-40): they reach the cap and fight; who keeps the stronger army?

defence(2, 0)
at(1min, () => {
    give(2, 3000)
    give(3, 3000)
})
at(15min, () => {
    give(2, 3000)
    give(3, 3000)
})
at(30min, () => {
    give(2, 3000)
    give(3, 3000)
})
